            </ul>
            <div class="ask">
              <span class="q">ThinkPad 14 in stock?</span>
              <span class="a">Yes, silver and black.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </figure>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3><span class="n mono">3</span>AirFone answers</h3>
        <figure class="app" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="bar"><img src="/brand/airfone-mark.svg" alt="" width="22" height="14" /><span>Live calls</span></div>
          <div class="body">
            <div class="live">
              <span class="ic on"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1z" fill="currentColor" /></svg></span>
              <span class="grow"><span class="val mono">+977 98XXXXXXXX</span><span class="lbl"><span class="dot"></span>AirFone answering · <span class="mono">0:07</span></span></span>
            </div>
            <p class="said" lang="ne">नमस्ते, सिटी इलेक्ट्रोनिक्स। के सहयोग गरूँ?</p>
